WEBVTT

01:56.000 --> 01:57.960
Luckily Mr. Zhu helped out.

01:58.759 --> 02:00.200
He talked to your principal.

02:00.200 --> 02:00.960
Said you're

02:00.960 --> 02:02.160
a really promising student.

02:02.800 --> 02:04.160
Otherwise getting back into school

02:04.320 --> 02:05.520
would've been a huge hassle.

02:08.320 --> 02:09.479
Once I'm back at school,

02:10.000 --> 02:10.680
you'll be here by yourself.

02:10.680 --> 02:11.560
Will you be okay?

02:13.840 --> 02:15.120
Of course I will.

02:15.240 --> 02:16.560
Don't underestimate your mom.

02:18.880 --> 02:20.200
Zhao Pock

02:20.200 --> 02:21.440
read my palm once.

02:21.840 --> 02:22.760
He said I'd

02:22.800 --> 02:24.680
have a turn for the better.

02:24.720 --> 02:26.400
Great luck with mentors

02:26.400 --> 02:27.400
and career.

02:27.760 --> 02:28.360
Zhao Pock?

02:28.720 --> 02:29.840
He did a reading for me too.

02:30.040 --> 02:31.440
Said I'll become a scientist one day.

02:32.079 --> 02:33.200
Total nonsense.

02:34.240 --> 02:35.600
I think his words hold true.

02:37.680 --> 02:38.640
Don't worry.

02:39.440 --> 02:40.360
Ye has paved the way

02:40.360 --> 02:41.880
for us.

02:42.200 --> 02:43.800
Besides, with the salon reopening,

02:43.920 --> 02:45.400
things will get better for sure.

02:45.920 --> 02:47.400
Supporting the whole family

02:47.480 --> 02:48.480
won't be a problem.

02:50.120 --> 02:50.840
You've got this?

02:52.800 --> 02:54.360
I've got this.

02:54.360 --> 02:55.720
What are you worried about?

02:55.720 --> 02:58.000
Grandma has her wheelchair.

02:58.120 --> 02:58.680
Liu Nian

02:58.680 --> 03:00.120
will help me run the salon.

03:00.160 --> 03:01.520
And Cici also lends a hand

03:01.520 --> 03:02.560
out there.

03:03.000 --> 03:04.440
What else could go wrong?

03:05.440 --> 03:06.840
I told you I can handle it,

03:06.960 --> 03:07.840
and handle it I will.

03:09.320 --> 03:10.000
You mean it?

03:11.080 --> 03:11.520
Right.

03:12.000 --> 03:12.720
I mean it.

03:52.440 --> 03:52.960
Mom.

03:55.000 --> 03:56.400
The moon is full tonight.

04:06.640 --> 04:07.320
Can I come in?

04:09.840 --> 04:10.560
Sure.

04:13.560 --> 04:14.520
I got foot bath sachets

04:14.680 --> 04:15.680
from Doctor Zhuang.

04:16.360 --> 04:17.320
Soak your feet for some time.

04:17.399 --> 04:18.360
It'll ease the soreness.

04:20.200 --> 04:21.399
You got a new haircut.

04:23.360 --> 04:24.440
Look more like a student now.

04:27.920 --> 04:28.520
Come on.

04:28.720 --> 04:29.960
The water's just right.

04:39.280 --> 04:40.560
This feels amazing.

04:41.080 --> 04:42.800
Like all my energy's flowing free.

04:50.080 --> 04:50.840
What are you laughing at?

04:51.760 --> 04:52.720
Looks like cooking pig trotters.

04:53.080 --> 04:53.920
You think so too, don't you?

04:57.560 --> 04:58.400
It really does.

04:59.880 --> 05:00.600
And the smell

05:01.280 --> 05:02.320
is pretty similar too.

05:02.720 --> 05:03.400
Funny you say that.

05:03.680 --> 05:04.480
There's Chinese prickly ash

05:04.480 --> 05:05.760
and cassia twig inside.

05:06.000 --> 05:07.480
So Doctor Zhuang really is

05:07.480 --> 05:08.720
braising pigs' trotters?

05:09.120 --> 05:10.240
He knows what he's doing.

05:10.720 --> 05:11.520
These herbs

05:11.520 --> 05:13.000
boost blood circulation

05:13.080 --> 05:14.240
and relax your muscles.

05:20.520 --> 05:22.040
Thanks a lot for today.

05:23.200 --> 05:23.800
Otherwise,

05:24.520 --> 05:25.280
I'd have

05:25.280 --> 05:26.400
struggled badly

05:26.720 --> 05:27.520
after those twenty laps.

05:30.320 --> 05:32.760
You didn't have to run all that.

05:33.159 --> 05:34.080
I did.

05:34.920 --> 05:35.960
A bet's a bet.

05:37.640 --> 05:41.640
It's also

05:42.240 --> 05:43.520
a wake-up call

05:43.520 --> 05:45.200
for slacking off lately.

05:46.920 --> 05:47.440
What do you mean?

05:48.600 --> 05:50.400
Even with my English score added,

05:51.159 --> 05:52.680
my monthly exam results

05:52.840 --> 05:53.520
still aren't enough

05:53.520 --> 05:54.800
for my dream college.

05:55.520 --> 05:56.360
What's more,

05:56.720 --> 05:58.400
when the college entrance exam comes,

05:58.720 --> 06:00.680
Cao Fan isn't my only rival.

06:01.600 --> 06:03.560
So I need to adjust

06:03.560 --> 06:04.760
my study methods

06:05.200 --> 06:06.960
and push myself harder.

06:09.080 --> 06:10.120
Do you believe I can make it?

06:10.560 --> 06:11.080
Absolutely.

06:11.680 --> 06:12.720
So sure about that?

06:12.960 --> 06:13.560
Why?

06:14.080 --> 06:14.640
No reason.

06:15.160 --> 06:15.880
I just do.

06:20.280 --> 06:21.280
Alright then.

06:22.000 --> 06:23.480
Do you also believe

06:23.640 --> 06:24.920
that I can get us both

06:25.240 --> 06:26.760
to be admitted to good universities?

06:27.120 --> 06:27.640
Well...

06:29.120 --> 06:30.280
I'm not like you.

06:31.680 --> 06:33.200
I haven't studied for years.

06:33.520 --> 06:34.200
Getting into college

06:34.840 --> 06:35.680
is almost impossible.

06:37.159 --> 06:38.600
Where there's a will, there's a way.

06:39.240 --> 06:40.520
How will you know if you don't try?

06:40.960 --> 06:41.440
But you really

06:42.400 --> 06:43.200
shouldn't waste your time

06:43.200 --> 06:44.240
on me.

06:44.560 --> 06:45.600
Besides, I'm back at school

06:46.200 --> 06:47.400
not to go to college.

06:47.560 --> 06:48.120
I know.

06:49.360 --> 06:51.000
Just to get a high school diploma.

06:52.159 --> 06:52.880
Exactly.

06:57.240 --> 06:57.840
Alright.

06:58.000 --> 06:58.520
A bit longer,

06:58.520 --> 06:59.600
they'll really become braised trotters.

07:01.720 --> 07:02.200
Lift your feet.

07:07.880 --> 07:08.520
Good night.

09:21.640 --> 09:22.760
Morning, Classmate Xing.

09:23.440 --> 09:24.760
Morning, Classmate Qing.

09:26.840 --> 09:28.160
You look

09:28.520 --> 09:29.320
much more proper now.

09:29.760 --> 09:30.400
Like I wasn't

09:30.400 --> 09:31.640
proper before.

09:31.880 --> 09:33.440
You used to be an engineer,

09:33.720 --> 09:34.920
now you're a student.

09:35.480 --> 09:36.160
Which do you prefer?

09:36.760 --> 09:37.280
Both are fine.

09:37.400 --> 09:38.200
Pick just one.

09:38.560 --> 09:39.440
Can't I pick both?

09:40.040 --> 09:40.920
Don't get carried away.

09:41.640 --> 09:42.600
You've turned

09:42.600 --> 09:43.800
more "E" lately.

09:43.800 --> 09:45.000
You even crack jokes now.

09:45.080 --> 09:45.720
"E"?

09:45.720 --> 09:46.640
What do you mean?

09:46.720 --> 09:48.000
Have you done the MBTI test?

09:48.240 --> 09:48.880
What's that?

09:49.520 --> 09:50.960
You were totally an introvert before,

09:51.000 --> 09:52.040
but now you're an extrovert.

09:52.400 --> 09:53.560
Introvert, extrovert...

09:53.880 --> 09:55.760
I just wanna be a student now.

09:56.520 --> 09:56.920
Let's go.

09:57.680 --> 09:58.120
Wait.

09:59.080 --> 10:00.400
You're not fully dressed

10:00.400 --> 10:01.040
as a student yet.

10:01.720 --> 10:02.560
Where's your name tag?

10:04.400 --> 10:04.880
Forgot to put it on.

10:08.120 --> 10:08.800
Let me help you.

10:20.320 --> 10:20.840
Done.

10:21.880 --> 10:22.360
Is it straight?

10:22.520 --> 10:22.920
Yep,

10:23.160 --> 10:23.800
perfect.

10:25.160 --> 10:25.560
Let's go.

10:25.640 --> 10:26.040
Yeah.

10:27.480 --> 10:29.080
Nice day today.

10:50.440 --> 10:51.080
What are you listening to?

10:53.560 --> 10:54.120
English.

10:54.520 --> 10:55.200
Listening practice.

10:57.840 --> 10:58.560
Listen with me.

11:00.840 --> 11:02.240
I'm not interested.

11:33.960 --> 11:34.440
So?

11:34.880 --> 11:35.440
How's it?

11:36.720 --> 11:37.200
Pretty good.

11:39.760 --> 11:41.200
What's the song called?

11:44.440 --> 11:45.360
"I promise"

11:47.600 --> 11:48.400
It's really nice.

11:52.600 --> 11:53.640
Let's listen to another one.

11:54.240 --> 11:54.880
Listening practice?

11:55.720 --> 11:56.280
Not for me.

12:00.480 --> 12:01.400
You have to.

12:06.760 --> 12:07.400
Fine, whatever you say.

12:40.200 --> 12:40.680
Oh, by the way,

12:40.880 --> 12:41.320
the...

13:41.440 --> 13:41.960
Well?

13:42.040 --> 13:42.600
Getting used to it?

13:43.200 --> 13:44.520
- This uniform is so uncomfortable.
- Ye.

13:44.720 --> 13:45.560
Ye.

13:47.880 --> 13:48.560
Who's this?

13:49.720 --> 13:50.600
Who else could it be?

13:51.960 --> 13:52.640
New sneakers.

13:53.160 --> 13:53.800
New haircut.

13:54.640 --> 13:55.200
Let's celebrate.

13:59.240 --> 14:00.720
You dare step on my new sneakers?

14:01.080 --> 14:01.800
You want your feet kicked?

14:01.840 --> 14:02.840
Don't you know?

14:02.880 --> 14:04.040
Step on new shoes

14:04.200 --> 14:05.000
for good luck.

14:05.040 --> 14:06.040
Pat a new haircut

14:06.120 --> 14:07.160
for wit and cheer.

14:08.200 --> 14:08.720
See?

14:09.040 --> 14:10.400
He doesn't stutter anymore

14:10.440 --> 14:11.160
since you came back.

14:11.360 --> 14:12.800
No kidding.

14:13.280 --> 14:14.760
I even planned to

14:14.840 --> 14:15.520
repeat senior year.

14:16.040 --> 14:17.400
Don't say such unlucky things.

14:18.520 --> 14:19.400
Then I'll tag along with you

14:19.400 --> 14:20.640
and Qing Ye from now on,

14:21.720 --> 14:23.200
study, eat and drink together.

14:23.400 --> 14:24.680
I'll stay in school right alongside you.

14:25.160 --> 14:26.600
Oh, stop that.

14:27.160 --> 14:27.800
Is it too late

14:27.800 --> 14:29.000
to quit school

14:29.320 --> 14:29.960
now?

14:30.480 --> 14:32.160
Yep.

14:32.560 --> 14:33.560
Yep.

14:33.840 --> 14:34.680
Yep.

14:34.960 --> 14:35.400
Wait.

14:35.400 --> 14:36.520
Wait for me!

14:36.680 --> 14:37.320
Here.

14:38.120 --> 14:38.560
Let's go.

14:49.080 --> 14:50.560
Actually, I really admire Xing Wu.

14:52.200 --> 14:52.960
For what?

14:53.960 --> 14:54.960
Few people in Anzi County

14:54.960 --> 14:55.920
dare to say no to my dad,

14:56.600 --> 14:57.280
but he did.

15:00.280 --> 15:01.240
That's just how he is.

15:01.960 --> 15:03.320
Once he sets his mind on something,

15:03.920 --> 15:04.520
he'll see it through

15:04.520 --> 15:05.360
no matter what.

15:06.760 --> 15:08.200
I wish I could be like him.

15:11.280 --> 15:12.200
Right, Shu Han,

15:12.800 --> 15:14.120
don't pick me up after school anymore.

15:15.880 --> 15:16.400
Why?

15:16.920 --> 15:17.960
Do you have other plans?

15:19.800 --> 15:21.160
I'll stay for evening study

15:21.160 --> 15:22.880
and review lessons with Qing Ye.

15:24.120 --> 15:25.440
You must be tired after work.

15:25.840 --> 15:26.960
I'll take a taxi home.

15:28.160 --> 15:29.080
Call me anytime

15:29.080 --> 15:29.960
if anything comes up.

15:46.360 --> 15:46.920
Sorry.

15:48.040 --> 15:48.960
I can't sign the contract.

15:49.920 --> 15:50.560
Why?

15:50.920 --> 15:52.120
If it's about the pay,

15:52.280 --> 15:52.920
I can talk to Mr. Ye

15:52.960 --> 15:53.880
to raise it for you.

15:54.080 --> 15:54.760
It'll be easy.

15:55.680 --> 15:56.160
No.

15:57.200 --> 15:58.160
It's not that.

15:59.960 --> 16:00.880
I've decided to go back to school.

16:01.600 --> 16:02.320
Back to school?

16:03.960 --> 16:04.840
Are you serious?

16:05.200 --> 16:05.840
Why did you suddenly

16:05.840 --> 16:06.640
change your mind?

16:09.800 --> 16:10.520
Just wanna get

16:11.560 --> 16:12.760
a high school diploma.

16:14.600 --> 16:15.640
Come on.

16:15.880 --> 16:17.000
If that was all you wanted,

16:17.000 --> 16:18.160
you'd have gone back long ago.

16:24.240 --> 16:25.120
It's because of Qing Ye, isn't it?

16:28.760 --> 16:29.800
I knew it.

16:30.760 --> 16:31.840
Spit it out. What's going on?

16:32.560 --> 16:33.760
I want to protect her

16:35.360 --> 16:36.360
and keep her away from trouble.

16:36.800 --> 16:38.040
Let her focus on the exam.

16:39.440 --> 16:40.080
Xing Wu,

16:41.840 --> 16:43.080
you care so much about her.

16:44.320 --> 16:45.520
Now you're

16:46.200 --> 16:46.960
giving up a job

16:46.960 --> 16:47.720
just for her?

16:51.800 --> 16:52.520
Fine.

16:53.160 --> 16:54.880
But as your friend, I have to say this.

16:55.600 --> 16:56.200
Someday

16:56.200 --> 16:57.440
Qing Ye will leave here.

16:57.440 --> 16:58.600
She'll leave Zhazhating,

16:59.040 --> 16:59.680
and head for

16:59.680 --> 17:00.840
bigger places.

17:01.240 --> 17:02.000
Maybe she'll even

17:02.040 --> 17:03.400
forget this place.

17:04.000 --> 17:04.599
I know.

17:05.319 --> 17:06.079
You can only

17:06.079 --> 17:07.280
walk beside her for now.

17:08.119 --> 17:08.720
I get that too.

17:08.800 --> 17:09.680
You do?

17:09.800 --> 17:10.520
Then what about later?

17:10.839 --> 17:11.560
What about your future?

17:17.720 --> 17:19.119
Whether she stays or goes,

17:19.599 --> 17:20.599
whether she remembers here or not,

17:21.359 --> 17:22.160
it doesn't matter.

17:22.520 --> 17:23.520
I just want her

17:24.440 --> 17:25.520
to get through this time

17:26.319 --> 17:27.760
smoothly and safely.

17:28.760 --> 17:30.160
I've always had your back.

17:32.360 --> 17:33.320
If you ever get tired of

17:33.880 --> 17:35.120
being a student,

17:35.760 --> 17:37.120
you're always welcome back again.

17:39.800 --> 17:41.120
I'm busy.

17:41.120 --> 17:42.040
You can see yourself out.

18:19.280 --> 18:20.000
Qing Ye.

18:20.840 --> 18:22.120
Could you do me a favor?

18:22.840 --> 18:23.440
Go ahead.

18:25.560 --> 18:26.960
Could you give this

18:26.960 --> 18:28.640
to your cousin, Xing Wu?

18:31.760 --> 18:32.680
Thanks.

18:39.160 --> 18:39.600
Wu.

18:40.040 --> 18:40.920
We heard you were amazing

18:40.920 --> 18:42.320
at FPS games.

18:42.720 --> 18:44.200
Everyone calls you Sniper King.

18:44.280 --> 18:44.720
Yeah.

18:44.720 --> 18:45.840
Play a couple rounds with us after school?

18:46.120 --> 18:46.920
That was ages ago.

18:47.160 --> 18:48.240
I quit long ago.

18:48.680 --> 18:49.160
Why?

18:49.520 --> 18:50.440
Focusing on studies now?

18:51.320 --> 18:52.600
No wonder you're top of our class.

18:52.640 --> 18:53.640
You always ace Physics.

18:53.680 --> 18:54.600
Got any tips

18:54.600 --> 18:55.200
to share?

18:55.600 --> 18:56.560
Teach us.

18:57.520 --> 18:58.240
I wanna know too.

18:58.520 --> 18:59.320
Why all gather round?

19:01.200 --> 19:02.560
No real tips.

19:03.720 --> 19:05.080
It's just interest.

19:05.200 --> 19:06.120
That's so vague.

19:06.320 --> 19:07.120
Tell us more.

19:07.680 --> 19:09.080
You'd better do more exercises

19:09.240 --> 19:10.520
instead of asking me.

19:10.880 --> 19:11.800
We all do

19:11.840 --> 19:12.880
the same exercises.

19:12.880 --> 19:14.000
How do you always come out on top?

19:14.040 --> 19:14.680
Yeah.

19:14.800 --> 19:15.760
What materials do you use?

19:16.120 --> 19:17.160
Don't you use the standard review books?

19:17.240 --> 19:18.600
Do you take extra tutoring classes?

19:18.880 --> 19:19.760
Taking private lessons?

19:19.800 --> 19:20.440
You must

19:20.520 --> 19:21.400
study late every night.

19:21.400 --> 19:22.080
Be quiet.

19:22.160 --> 19:22.720
Definitely grinding away.

19:22.800 --> 19:24.400
I didn't expect Xing Wu

19:24.400 --> 19:25.520
to be this popular

19:25.600 --> 19:26.600
right after coming back.

19:28.240 --> 19:29.000
Well,

19:29.880 --> 19:31.280
I'm just that charming.

19:32.200 --> 19:32.760
Yeah.

19:32.760 --> 19:33.200
Right.

19:33.200 --> 19:34.840
Wu just transferred into our class,

19:34.880 --> 19:36.280
but he's good at games,

19:36.320 --> 19:38.920
studies well, and is handsome.

19:39.080 --> 19:39.600
He's so...

19:39.680 --> 19:40.800
Excellent.

19:41.680 --> 19:42.600
Too excellent.

19:43.280 --> 19:44.000
No wonder he's admired

19:44.000 --> 19:45.080
by so many people.

19:46.120 --> 19:46.760
See?

19:47.080 --> 19:48.360
Someone gave you this yogurt.

19:48.680 --> 19:49.280
Yogurt?

19:49.960 --> 19:50.800
From whom? Who?

19:52.160 --> 19:52.840
Alright, move along everyone.

19:52.960 --> 19:53.400
Come on.

19:53.520 --> 19:54.280
Move along now, guys.

19:54.520 --> 19:55.200
Move along.

20:00.840 --> 20:01.680
Oh, yogurt?

20:02.280 --> 20:03.160
If you don't want it, I'll take it.

20:03.920 --> 20:04.400
Thanks.

20:20.200 --> 20:21.120
Where did you get that yogurt?

20:21.440 --> 20:22.120
From Xing Wu.

20:22.440 --> 20:23.200
Who said you could drink it?

20:23.520 --> 20:24.440
It wasn't for you.

20:24.600 --> 20:25.800
Hey, come on.

20:26.120 --> 20:26.800
You think it's yours?

20:26.880 --> 20:28.680
I bought it for Xing Wu.

20:34.000 --> 20:34.760
Here, take it back.

20:34.840 --> 20:35.360
Take it.

20:35.640 --> 20:36.120
Get lost.

20:37.200 --> 20:39.440
I bought it for Xing Wu.

21:08.360 --> 21:09.040
Let's get a late-night snack.

21:10.720 --> 21:11.280
Nah.

21:14.120 --> 21:14.640
Ye.

21:15.040 --> 21:15.640
Let's go grab something to eat.

21:16.040 --> 21:16.520
No.

21:17.160 --> 21:17.680
Want some?

21:18.240 --> 21:19.520
I don't want the leftovers.

21:21.440 --> 21:21.960
Qing Ye.

21:23.280 --> 21:23.680
Yeah.

21:25.600 --> 21:27.200
I'm fine with English, but I came across

21:27.520 --> 21:29.040
some math problems yesterday

21:29.600 --> 21:30.640
and need your help.

21:31.200 --> 21:32.720
It's a new question type,

21:33.080 --> 21:34.840
yet it's still about functions.

21:35.280 --> 21:36.240
Look at Ye Yingjian.

21:36.840 --> 21:38.400
Ever since the monthly exam,

21:38.560 --> 21:40.080
he's been hanging around Ye every night.

21:40.240 --> 21:40.920
Can't get rid of him.

21:41.120 --> 21:42.880
If I wasn't stuck on my studies,

21:42.960 --> 21:44.080
I'd squeeze right between them

21:44.080 --> 21:44.800
and chase him away.

21:46.600 --> 21:47.240
Don't bother me.

21:47.840 --> 21:48.920
Go find Big G to get a snack.

21:49.880 --> 21:50.560
Big G?

21:51.640 --> 21:52.560
Forget it.

21:52.600 --> 21:53.800
Class just ended a minute ago,

21:53.840 --> 21:54.800
and he's already gone.

21:55.400 --> 21:56.720
He said something before leaving.

21:57.400 --> 21:58.880
"I can't make it."

21:58.920 --> 22:01.240
"Got something else important to do."

22:17.240 --> 22:18.000
Take care of your hands.

22:31.520 --> 22:32.520
Smells great.

22:43.440 --> 22:44.000
Thanks.

22:59.160 --> 22:59.920
It's supposed to be

22:59.960 --> 23:00.840
about the four of us:

23:00.960 --> 23:04.160
you and Qing Ye, Big G and me.

23:04.960 --> 23:05.520
But look at me,

23:06.320 --> 23:07.960
left out.

23:07.960 --> 23:09.280
I'm all alone.

23:09.560 --> 23:10.520
I'm leaving. Enjoy your wait for her.

23:12.640 --> 23:13.640
Xing Wu,

23:13.960 --> 23:14.840
we heard you can fix phones.

23:14.880 --> 23:15.720
Mine's broken.

23:15.720 --> 23:16.640
Could you take a look?

23:16.720 --> 23:17.600
Mine too.

23:17.680 --> 23:18.360
Mine as well.

23:18.440 --> 23:18.880
Okay.

23:19.200 --> 23:20.000
You're so nice.

23:20.240 --> 23:21.200
I'll check them later

23:21.240 --> 23:22.440
and let you know in a few days.

23:22.640 --> 23:24.760
Thank you so much.

23:24.920 --> 23:25.320
Well.

23:25.520 --> 23:26.040
No problem.

23:26.200 --> 23:26.680
Thanks.

23:43.560 --> 23:44.320
Volunteer.

23:44.520 --> 23:45.360
Volunteer.

23:45.400 --> 23:46.120
Volunteer. Right?

23:46.120 --> 23:47.840
You've got enough vocabulary.

23:48.440 --> 23:49.480
English class feels

23:49.520 --> 23:50.520
pretty easy now.

23:51.360 --> 23:53.520
I just wrote that word down...

24:05.920 --> 24:07.000
I'm off.

24:08.240 --> 24:08.720
Bye.

24:08.960 --> 24:09.520
See you tomorrow.

24:09.640 --> 24:10.080
Bye.

24:37.640 --> 24:38.760
Fun studying with him, huh?

24:39.360 --> 24:40.800
Enjoy chatting with them, huh?

24:43.640 --> 24:44.560
Quite popular.

24:46.160 --> 24:46.720
Not bad.

24:47.120 --> 24:48.240
Gotta open them up and take a look?

24:48.600 --> 24:49.400
Of course.

24:49.640 --> 24:50.640
And one by one,

24:50.640 --> 24:51.400
check carefully.

24:52.040 --> 24:52.920
One by one?

24:53.880 --> 24:55.400
So it's more than one?

24:56.560 --> 24:57.960
Yeah, quite a few actually.

24:58.320 --> 24:58.920
I didn't expect

24:58.920 --> 24:59.800
this much popularity either.

25:02.080 --> 25:02.920
Enjoy the attention.

25:04.160 --> 25:05.640
I can't have all the fun alone.

25:05.800 --> 25:06.640
It's all thanks to you.

25:06.840 --> 25:07.600
Let's share the joy.

25:08.080 --> 25:09.000
What exactly are you implying?

25:11.440 --> 25:12.240
My treat for late-night snacks.

25:16.440 --> 25:17.960
Got a few phones to fix.

25:18.280 --> 25:18.960
Happy to

25:19.400 --> 25:20.280
earn some extra cash.

25:23.880 --> 25:26.720
You were talking about phones just now?

25:29.240 --> 25:30.600
What else did you think?

25:33.640 --> 25:34.240
Nothing.

25:37.160 --> 25:37.880
You're going the wrong way.

25:40.000 --> 25:40.520
This way.

25:52.720 --> 25:53.520
What do you feel like eating?

25:54.760 --> 25:55.880
Anything is fine.

26:05.200 --> 26:06.440
I'm so full.

26:06.920 --> 26:08.240
I'll never

26:08.240 --> 26:09.560
eat this much again.

26:09.720 --> 26:10.920
Weren't you just saying

26:11.240 --> 26:12.400
how tasty everything was?

26:12.440 --> 26:13.280
"This dish was great, and that one too."

26:16.880 --> 26:18.160
Why is it raining all of a sudden?

26:18.160 --> 26:18.720
Come here.

26:20.040 --> 26:21.600
The forecast didn't

26:22.080 --> 26:23.160
mention rain at all.

26:23.160 --> 26:24.160
It just came pouring down.

26:24.400 --> 26:25.240
Probably a passing shower.

26:25.360 --> 26:26.560
Comes fast, goes fast.

26:27.520 --> 26:28.680
Crap, didn't bring an umbrella.

26:29.680 --> 26:30.920
Wait here.

26:30.920 --> 26:31.400
I'll run back to get one.

26:31.520 --> 26:32.120
No need.

26:32.240 --> 26:33.120
It's just a short distance.

26:33.200 --> 26:34.200
Let's just dash home together.

26:34.520 --> 26:35.400
Run through the rain?

26:35.920 --> 26:37.520
We've got soaked many times before.

26:38.880 --> 26:39.560
Hold on a second.

26:39.680 --> 26:40.320
I've got an extra jacket.

26:41.560 --> 26:42.160
Come closer.

26:42.720 --> 26:43.120
Move in a bit.

26:44.320 --> 26:44.720
Here.

26:46.880 --> 26:47.440
Hold on tight.

26:47.680 --> 26:48.320
Yeah.

26:49.240 --> 26:49.840
Are we really gonna do this?

26:50.880 --> 26:51.440
Get ready.

26:53.880 --> 26:54.360
Three.

26:54.960 --> 26:55.520
Two.

26:55.880 --> 26:56.360
One.

27:40.280 --> 27:40.840
Gosh.

27:45.720 --> 27:46.200
Wait.

27:52.520 --> 27:52.960
Go inside.

27:53.440 --> 27:54.320
Don't catch a cold.

27:54.440 --> 27:54.920
Okay.

29:32.280 --> 29:33.680
[What is Xing Wu]

29:34.240 --> 29:35.280
[doing right now?]

29:38.280 --> 29:40.000
[What are you thinking about, Qing Ye?]

29:40.640 --> 29:41.600
[Go to bed.]

29:48.720 --> 29:49.320
Grandma.

29:49.760 --> 29:50.680
Still awake?

29:52.000 --> 29:52.880
Ye.

29:53.360 --> 29:54.360
Come on in.

29:58.320 --> 29:59.920
You're still up?

30:00.800 --> 30:01.680
I was just thinking

30:01.680 --> 30:04.080
I'd wind this yarn before sleeping.

30:05.320 --> 30:06.200
Then let me help you.

30:06.560 --> 30:07.080
Sure.

30:07.680 --> 30:08.520
Like this, right?

30:10.000 --> 30:10.400
Right.

30:10.720 --> 30:11.160
Okay.

30:11.160 --> 30:11.640
Stretch your hands

30:11.800 --> 30:12.600
out straight.

30:12.800 --> 30:13.440
Hold them straight.

30:13.640 --> 30:14.040
Okay.

30:14.920 --> 30:15.280
Yeah.

30:19.440 --> 30:20.920
Why are you still up so late?

30:21.400 --> 30:21.920
Well?

30:22.200 --> 30:23.680
Got something on your mind?

30:24.400 --> 30:24.880
No.

30:26.720 --> 30:27.520
Really?

30:30.440 --> 30:31.040
Well...

30:31.640 --> 30:32.360
A little bit.

30:34.040 --> 30:35.000
Tell me about it.

30:39.920 --> 30:40.840
Lately

30:41.000 --> 30:42.320
I've felt all jumbled up inside.

30:43.080 --> 30:44.520
I keep thinking about

30:45.560 --> 30:47.120
one thing over and over.

30:48.720 --> 30:51.920
I just want to figure it out.

30:53.280 --> 30:54.280
It's like there's someone

30:54.920 --> 30:55.800
who makes your

30:56.120 --> 30:57.920
mood swing up and down.

30:58.240 --> 30:59.760
Grandma, do you know that feeling?

31:01.360 --> 31:01.720
Well,

31:02.240 --> 31:02.760
you mean

31:03.080 --> 31:04.400
when he's happy,

31:04.640 --> 31:05.760
you feel happy too.

31:05.960 --> 31:07.080
When he's down,

31:07.080 --> 31:08.240
you start to worry.

31:08.520 --> 31:09.840
Is that how it is?

31:10.000 --> 31:10.520
Exactly.

31:11.440 --> 31:12.400
I feel my emotions

31:13.000 --> 31:15.440
are all over the place.

31:16.240 --> 31:17.760
I know I shouldn't be like this,

31:17.920 --> 31:18.440
but

31:18.760 --> 31:19.800
I just can't make sense

31:19.800 --> 31:20.800
of my feelings.

31:22.920 --> 31:24.440
If everything in life

31:25.160 --> 31:26.840
were crystal clear,

31:26.840 --> 31:28.160
it would lose all its charm.

31:29.440 --> 31:30.640
If you never make

31:31.200 --> 31:32.280
a single mistake in life,

31:33.120 --> 31:34.200
then that in itself is wrong.

31:35.960 --> 31:36.880
You'll be fine.

31:37.560 --> 31:38.160
You know.

31:38.520 --> 31:39.440
Don't fret too much.

31:39.880 --> 31:40.720
It's okay.

31:40.800 --> 31:41.360
Don't worry.

31:43.880 --> 31:44.440
Grandma,

31:45.520 --> 31:46.920
you truly are a philosopher.

31:48.360 --> 31:49.240
Philosopher?

31:50.800 --> 31:51.960
What philosopher?

31:52.120 --> 31:53.640
It's a compliment.

31:54.120 --> 31:56.520
It means you're insightful.

31:58.160 --> 31:58.960
Who told you that?

32:01.800 --> 32:02.760
Your grandson,

32:03.440 --> 32:04.040
Xing Wu.

32:04.320 --> 32:05.680
Don't listen to him.

33:23.960 --> 33:24.760
Lanfang.

33:26.160 --> 33:27.000
Xing Wu.

33:29.560 --> 33:30.320
Open the door!

33:30.720 --> 33:31.200
Cici.

33:31.200 --> 33:31.920
- Lanfang.
- What's wrong?

33:32.280 --> 33:32.880
It's an emergency.

33:34.120 --> 33:35.600
Something terrible happened.

33:35.680 --> 33:36.360
What is it?

33:36.360 --> 33:37.760
My son Big G is missing.

33:38.200 --> 33:39.320
Missing?

33:39.480 --> 33:41.000
When did you notice?

33:41.120 --> 33:42.080
Just now.

33:42.720 --> 33:43.400
Calm down.

33:43.400 --> 33:44.320
Come inside.

33:46.280 --> 33:47.560
Easy, easy.

33:47.720 --> 33:48.520
Take your time.

33:49.280 --> 33:49.960
What happened?

33:50.120 --> 33:50.920
I scolded him

33:51.520 --> 33:52.640
a little yesterday,

33:53.000 --> 33:54.160
and he got upset.

33:54.440 --> 33:54.920
What's going on?

33:55.120 --> 33:55.520
Wu.

33:55.640 --> 33:56.120
What happened?

33:56.400 --> 33:57.640
Has Big G contacted you?

33:58.080 --> 33:58.560
No.

33:59.200 --> 33:59.720
Oh no.

34:00.080 --> 34:01.640
He must have run away from home.

34:01.720 --> 34:02.480
Calm down.

34:02.480 --> 34:03.160
Tell us everything step by step.

34:03.160 --> 34:04.000
What exactly happened?

34:04.440 --> 34:06.080
I scolded him a little yesterday.

34:06.080 --> 34:07.840
He got mad and talked back,

34:07.960 --> 34:09.760
so we had a fight.

34:10.400 --> 34:11.360
Big G isn't

34:11.360 --> 34:12.400
the type to quarrel.

34:12.520 --> 34:14.520
After the fight,

34:14.719 --> 34:15.960
he slammed the door and left.

34:16.880 --> 34:17.840
I even said to him in anger,

34:17.960 --> 34:19.000
"Don't come back if you leave!"

34:19.920 --> 34:22.120
You didn't mean it, right?

34:22.159 --> 34:23.880
I've said far worse things to Wu

34:23.880 --> 34:25.320
when we fought.

34:26.520 --> 34:27.239
I thought he'd just

34:27.560 --> 34:28.960
go out to cool off, but when I

34:29.440 --> 34:30.440
checked his room this morning,

34:31.199 --> 34:32.120
he wasn't there.

34:32.199 --> 34:33.280
His bed was untouched.

34:34.239 --> 34:34.719
He didn't

34:34.719 --> 34:35.880
come home all night.

34:36.120 --> 34:37.159
Have you called him?

34:37.159 --> 34:38.040
Did he pick up?

34:38.080 --> 34:38.520
I...

34:44.960 --> 34:46.520
His phone is with me.

34:47.120 --> 34:48.280
I took it away, afraid he'd

34:48.280 --> 34:49.239
get into online dating.

34:49.639 --> 34:50.719
Online dating?

34:51.320 --> 34:51.719
Seriously?

34:51.800 --> 34:52.880
Big G

34:52.880 --> 34:53.960
is such an honest kid.

34:54.199 --> 34:55.320
That's impossible.

34:55.320 --> 34:56.159
Don't jump to conclusions.

34:56.159 --> 34:57.080
You know.

34:57.120 --> 34:58.520
Kids mature early these days.

35:00.800 --> 35:01.360
Wu.

35:02.120 --> 35:03.560
Get his phone unlocked.

35:03.800 --> 35:04.520
Let me have a look.

35:05.920 --> 35:06.760
Sorry.

35:07.680 --> 35:08.760
I can't do that.

35:10.800 --> 35:11.200
What?

35:11.520 --> 35:12.560
Then what do I do?

35:12.720 --> 35:13.920
Where can I find him?

35:14.120 --> 35:14.920
I'll go with you

35:15.040 --> 35:15.960
to the police station.

35:16.400 --> 35:17.120
Alright.

35:17.960 --> 35:18.520
Wu.

35:18.600 --> 35:19.440
Please let me know

35:19.440 --> 35:20.240
if he contacts you.

35:20.280 --> 35:21.360
Sure, no problem.

35:21.360 --> 35:21.720
Let's go.

35:21.760 --> 35:22.560
You two keep an eye on the salon.

35:22.760 --> 35:23.160
Oh, Big G.

35:24.120 --> 35:24.680
Don't worry.

35:29.640 --> 35:31.080
Why won't you unlock it?

35:31.200 --> 35:32.840
We're friends. That's not cool.

35:33.280 --> 35:34.880
It's an invasion of privacy.

35:35.000 --> 35:36.200
What if he's in danger?

35:36.200 --> 35:36.960
What then?

35:37.080 --> 35:38.000
I don't think so.

35:38.560 --> 35:39.720
I know him well.

35:39.960 --> 35:41.600
He must have something troubling him.

35:42.760 --> 35:43.520
You haven't seen him?

35:45.120 --> 35:45.880
Alright, alright.

35:46.240 --> 35:46.920
Got it.

35:47.360 --> 35:48.320
If you see him,

35:48.320 --> 35:49.280
call me anytime.

35:50.560 --> 35:51.160
Okay, okay.

35:58.760 --> 36:00.000
I asked a few friends.

36:00.120 --> 36:01.280
None of them have seen Big G.

36:01.880 --> 36:03.560
Not at internet cafes, arcades,

36:03.800 --> 36:04.440
or hotels.

36:04.440 --> 36:05.240
No sign of him.

36:06.040 --> 36:07.600
I asked our classmates.

36:07.680 --> 36:09.320
No one's heard from him.

36:10.680 --> 36:11.920
Big G has been

36:12.160 --> 36:12.880
acting

36:12.880 --> 36:13.840
really strange lately.

36:14.440 --> 36:16.080
Yeah, something's definitely off.

36:16.920 --> 36:18.000
What's off?

36:18.160 --> 36:20.720
Lots of things.

36:21.680 --> 36:23.280
Ever since the semester started,

36:24.520 --> 36:25.640
I've noticed something's wrong.

36:25.880 --> 36:26.960
He seldom walked home with me

36:27.000 --> 36:28.000
after school.

36:28.320 --> 36:29.320
He's always glued to his phone,

36:29.320 --> 36:30.160
grinning to himself.

36:30.440 --> 36:31.360
Once, I even caught him

36:31.360 --> 36:32.200
chatting online at an internet cafe.

36:32.320 --> 36:34.080
Why are you here?

36:34.160 --> 36:35.320
My mom went with them

36:35.320 --> 36:36.120
to the police station.

36:36.200 --> 36:37.560
I came to mooch a meal.

36:37.880 --> 36:38.520
You full?

36:38.720 --> 36:39.320
Yeah.

36:40.400 --> 36:40.920
Thanks.

36:41.880 --> 36:42.400
I already...

36:43.880 --> 36:44.440
It's fine.

36:45.000 --> 36:47.280
Great minds care not for petty trifles.

36:47.440 --> 36:48.360
I don't overreact

36:48.840 --> 36:49.920
and call the police over nothing

36:49.920 --> 36:51.000
like my mom does.

36:51.000 --> 36:51.640
Why bother?

36:52.000 --> 36:52.440
You know.

36:52.440 --> 36:53.720
Big G isn't that fragile.

36:54.240 --> 36:55.600
I bet he's just

36:55.720 --> 36:56.680
hiding somewhere

36:56.680 --> 36:57.440
to clear his head.

36:58.880 --> 36:59.840
You mean

36:59.840 --> 37:00.840
once he works things out,

37:01.320 --> 37:02.800
he might just give us a call?

37:03.400 --> 37:04.120
Maybe.

37:10.520 --> 37:10.920
Hello?

37:11.520 --> 37:12.000
Wu.

37:12.360 --> 37:12.920
Big G?

37:16.880 --> 37:18.400
Where are you?

37:19.080 --> 37:20.000
I'm on Chang Island.

37:20.600 --> 37:21.280
Chang Island?

37:22.240 --> 37:23.040
What are you doing there?

37:24.760 --> 37:25.680
Long story.

37:26.360 --> 37:28.080
Hey, you left without your phone,

37:28.080 --> 37:29.360
didn't come home last night.

37:29.680 --> 37:30.960
Your mom's been frantic looking for you.

37:31.120 --> 37:31.760
Don't!

37:32.360 --> 37:33.400
Don't tell her I'm on Chang Island.

37:33.520 --> 37:34.240
Please.

37:34.760 --> 37:36.000
Your mom was so worried.

37:36.120 --> 37:36.800
She's probably

37:36.840 --> 37:38.040
at the police station by now.

37:38.800 --> 37:39.600
Wu, why...

37:39.760 --> 37:40.320
Why didn't you

37:40.560 --> 37:42.160
stop her?

37:42.360 --> 37:43.400
I did try, but she

37:43.520 --> 37:44.200
wouldn't listen.

37:44.360 --> 37:45.280
Big G.

37:45.640 --> 37:46.880
We can keep your secret for you,

37:46.880 --> 37:47.920
but you need to let your mom know

37:47.920 --> 37:48.760
that you're safe.

37:48.760 --> 37:49.840
She's beyond worried.

37:51.320 --> 37:53.520
Okay, I'll tell her.

37:54.560 --> 37:55.400
When are you coming back?

37:56.400 --> 37:57.120
Don't know.

37:57.160 --> 37:59.400
Things are pretty complicated over here.

38:02.320 --> 38:03.560
Hey, I'm not done yet.

38:07.880 --> 38:08.400
Young man,

38:08.480 --> 38:09.840
I'm in a rush to deliver goods.

38:09.880 --> 38:11.920
One more minute.

38:12.200 --> 38:13.080
Just one minute.

38:13.120 --> 38:14.200
Okay, make it quick.

38:14.280 --> 38:14.760
Hurry, hurry.

38:14.760 --> 38:15.360
Thanks, thanks.

38:21.640 --> 38:22.120
Mom.

38:22.560 --> 38:23.160
It's me.

38:24.000 --> 38:25.080
Box it up and get it shipped out.

38:26.520 --> 38:29.280
We have to take a boat to Chang Island.

38:31.000 --> 38:32.040
You going to find him?

38:32.440 --> 38:33.440
I'll go with you.

38:33.800 --> 38:34.840
But there are only three ferries a day.

38:34.880 --> 38:35.400
The morning one

38:35.400 --> 38:36.320
has probably already left.

38:38.320 --> 38:39.920
Every family in Zhazhating has a boat.

38:42.960 --> 38:43.520
Kyle.

38:44.200 --> 38:44.600
Here.

38:48.800 --> 38:49.400
Have some water.

38:54.600 --> 38:56.840
I've got a hunch.

38:57.960 --> 38:58.360
What is it?

38:58.600 --> 38:59.080
Look at this.

39:01.040 --> 39:02.520
This post is from Shi Min's Moments.

39:02.640 --> 39:03.240
The photo here

39:03.920 --> 39:05.320
is exactly the same as Big G's

39:05.320 --> 39:05.920
Moments cover picture.

39:06.320 --> 39:07.520
So it's about Shi Min.

39:09.280 --> 39:10.000
I don't know for sure,

39:10.360 --> 39:11.720
but Shi Min told me before

39:12.000 --> 39:12.960
that she boards at school

39:13.120 --> 39:14.160
because her commute

39:14.200 --> 39:15.000
is such a hassle.

39:15.320 --> 39:16.760
She has to transfer three times.

39:17.000 --> 39:18.320
Her family lives on Chang Island.

39:18.840 --> 39:20.560
You're like a real detective.

39:20.840 --> 39:21.560
Girls just

39:21.560 --> 39:22.880
have a sixth sense

39:23.440 --> 39:24.600
about this stuff.

39:24.960 --> 39:25.920
Who's close to whom,

39:25.960 --> 39:26.760
who's not getting along,

39:26.760 --> 39:27.840
you can just feel it.

39:28.400 --> 39:29.240
So should we give Shi Min

39:29.240 --> 39:30.160
a call and ask?

39:30.360 --> 39:31.240
Yeah, I'll call her now.

39:37.800 --> 39:38.960
Hello? Qing Ye?

39:39.720 --> 39:40.520
Hi, Shi Min.

39:40.960 --> 39:42.200
Have you been in touch with Big G?

39:42.440 --> 39:44.680
He's with me right now.

39:47.920 --> 39:50.040
Please send your location quickly.

39:50.280 --> 39:51.520
Big G's mom is frantic.

39:51.520 --> 39:52.560
She even went to the police.

39:54.000 --> 39:54.600
Let's go.

39:55.120 --> 39:55.720
How are we getting there?

40:00.600 --> 40:01.360
You can sail?

40:01.600 --> 40:03.080
Don't judge a book by its cover.

40:03.320 --> 40:04.680
Everyone here in Zhazhating

40:04.680 --> 40:05.680
knows how to sail a boat.

40:08.600 --> 40:09.200
Let's head out.

40:09.720 --> 40:10.400
Alright, Captain.

40:18.720 --> 40:19.360
Hold on tight.

40:20.120 --> 40:20.680
Let's go.

40:37.280 --> 40:37.880
Thanks.

40:37.880 --> 40:39.160
We withdraw the report.

40:39.840 --> 40:40.760
Hurry.

40:41.200 --> 40:42.040
- What's going in?
- Quick, quick.

40:42.560 --> 40:43.240
Slow down.

40:43.760 --> 40:45.120
Come with me. He's on Chang Island.

40:45.280 --> 40:46.720
How did you know

40:46.720 --> 40:47.680
he's there?

40:47.720 --> 40:49.040
I heard people talking on his call.

40:49.080 --> 40:49.760
They mentioned

40:50.280 --> 40:52.000
farms and oysters.

40:52.600 --> 40:53.920
Only Chang Island around here

40:53.960 --> 40:55.080
has oyster farms.

40:55.240 --> 40:56.040
Yeah.

40:56.240 --> 40:57.680
But the island is huge.

40:57.720 --> 40:59.000
Are we going door to door?

40:59.200 --> 41:01.400
I will if I have to.

41:02.240 --> 41:02.920
It's all my fault.

41:02.920 --> 41:04.560
I shouldn't have scolded him yesterday.

41:05.160 --> 41:06.320
Boys get scolded now and then,

41:06.320 --> 41:07.520
it's no big deal.

41:07.880 --> 41:08.240
I...

41:08.880 --> 41:11.200
I even hit him.

41:11.720 --> 41:13.240
You did?

41:14.080 --> 41:15.760
I patted his back,

41:15.960 --> 41:16.760
tapped his head

41:16.760 --> 41:17.920
and pulled his ears.

41:18.640 --> 41:19.440
That's nothing.

41:19.520 --> 41:21.120
It doesn't count as hitting in my family.

41:22.160 --> 41:23.120
I also said some harsh things.

41:23.880 --> 41:24.800
"You stutter"

41:24.800 --> 41:25.760
"so much."

41:25.760 --> 41:27.000
"Which girl would like you?"

41:27.120 --> 41:28.080
"If you don't study hard,"

41:28.080 --> 41:28.880
"what's going to become of you?"

41:32.960 --> 41:33.840
Did those words

41:33.920 --> 41:35.240
hurt his pride badly?

41:35.880 --> 41:36.560
Yeah.

41:38.400 --> 41:39.360
I'm worried he might do something silly,

41:40.240 --> 41:41.240
like jump into the sea.

41:42.360 --> 41:43.120
Don't talk nonsense.

41:43.360 --> 41:43.840
Yufen.

41:44.680 --> 41:45.880
Doesn't your husband

41:45.880 --> 41:46.440
sail to Chang Island often?

41:47.440 --> 41:48.120
Yes, he does.

41:48.600 --> 41:49.680
Head back to Zhazhating Pier

41:49.760 --> 41:50.400
right now.

41:50.560 --> 41:51.880
He can take us over by boat.

41:51.880 --> 41:52.240
Let's go.

41:52.880 --> 41:53.720
Hurry.

41:54.040 --> 41:54.800
Wait for me.

41:54.920 --> 41:56.000
Come on.

41:56.080 --> 41:56.520
Gosh.

42:02.120 --> 42:02.520
Wait.

42:03.160 --> 42:03.960
Where's the boat?

42:04.200 --> 42:05.920
Yeah, where is it?

42:06.560 --> 42:06.920
Oh, no.

42:07.200 --> 42:07.800
Oh crap, crap.

42:08.080 --> 42:09.040
The keys are gone too.

42:09.320 --> 42:10.200
Seriously, who?

42:10.480 --> 42:12.400
Who took our boat?

42:12.440 --> 42:13.520
I don't even

42:13.560 --> 42:14.800
need to think.

42:15.040 --> 42:16.040
It must be your boy.

42:16.080 --> 42:16.960
He took it.

42:17.080 --> 42:17.800
Kyle.

42:18.000 --> 42:19.880
I'm going to beat you into next week!

42:20.080 --> 42:20.760
Let's go.

42:20.960 --> 42:21.640
Take the ferry instead.

42:21.760 --> 42:22.200
Hurry up.

42:22.400 --> 42:22.720
Okay.

42:22.760 --> 42:23.160
Come on.

42:23.240 --> 42:24.200
Honey, you get back to work.

42:24.240 --> 42:24.960
We're off.

42:57.520 --> 42:58.400
We're almost there.

43:13.080 --> 43:13.920
This place is huge.

43:17.600 --> 43:18.480
Careful.

43:29.880 --> 43:31.520
It's so big and crowded here.

43:31.560 --> 43:32.120
Excuse me, excuse me.

43:32.560 --> 43:34.040
Some people are fully covered up.

43:34.040 --> 43:35.080
How can we find him?

43:35.880 --> 43:36.600
I've asked around.

43:37.000 --> 43:38.240
This is exactly the seafood farm

43:38.240 --> 43:38.800
run by the Shi family.
